Media uploads for the x gem, built on the HTTP client in x-core.
- X::Uploads::MediaUpload uploads images, GIFs, videos, and subtitles. Videos,
  subtitles, and a GIF larger than a single request takes are split into chunks
  that upload in parallel, with retries, and processing can be awaited.
- X::Uploads::Account updates the authenticated user's profile image and banner
  through the v1.1 API, at the host of the base URL of the client it is given.

Installing x installs this gem too.
